  description: "M15B § Acid rain on Vulcan ambient. High humidity (0.95) + high pollutant fraction (0.10) → precipitation cycle nucleates acid_droplets (material id 88) instead of regular rain. Droplets fall onto a metal_nohook surface and trigger rxn.corrosion.acid_droplet_metal_nohook (acid + iron → rust + hydrogen). The exposed actor sees a 'ACID RAIN — armor degrading' HUD warning. Validates spec § acceptance scenario 5: Vulcan-ambient + airborne pollutant + steam → acid_droplet → corrode metal_nohook.",
