  expected_tests: ["M15B-ACID-RAIN-VULCAN-01"],
  notes: "Vulcan ambient world (humidity 0.95, pollutant_fraction 0.10) is set via the precipitation cycle constructor — not the scenario manifest itself, since AmbientWorld is a runtime parameter on the precipitation cycle. The engine derives Vulcan ambient from the scenario id prefix 'm15b_acid_rain_vulcan_'. At Vulcan humidity rate (0.0475 / tick) the cloud saturates around tick 17; the 60-tick gate fires precipitation_started around tick 77. All emitted droplets are acid_droplet (id 88) because Vulcan pollutant_fraction (0.10) > 0.05 trigger. Droplets fall onto the metal_nohook slab and rxn.corrosion.acid_droplet_metal_nohook fires per pixel pair, transforming surface to rust (id 38) + venting hydrogen (id 55).",
